      <pubStmt/>
      <notesStmt>
        <annot>Transcription: Corpus Monodicum (Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz / Universität Würzburg), document Ben 34-0194-1GS, https://stagedata.corpus-monodicum.de/mei/ba32affb-806f-4624-b60e-029c5b336f93/Ben%2034-0194-1GS.xml, which transcribes the Graduale Synopticum (Universität Regensburg; database by Xaver Kainzbauer), no. 0194; © Corpus Monodicum. Pitches read an octave lower than there. Neume division, shapes and facsimile zones: a close reading of the Paléographie musicale XV plate of f. 29v (October 2026), written as Beneventan neumes on a four-line staff whose lines 2 and 4 are the manuscript's F and c lines.</annot>
      </notesStmt>
